{"timestamp": 1779342230.7981381, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 21, "data": {"caller": "player_5", "reason": "Frank reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "storage", "victim_name": "Alice"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779342230.798571, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 21, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779342240.817895, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 21, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I just found Alice's body down in Storage. My route this round was Electrical to Medbay, up to Upper Engine, back down through Medbay, and finally into Storage where I found her. \n\nWhile I was up in Upper Engine, I saw Bob there for a bit, so Bob can hopefully vouch for me being on the left side of the map earlier. I didn't see anyone leaving Storage or in Medbay right before I went down. Did anyone see someone heading towards the bottom of the map recently? Charlie, Diana, where were you guys?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779342252.9112036, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 21, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I spawned in Storage at the start of the round, then I moved up to Medbay and over to Electrical where I've been doing my task. I didn't see Alice in Storage when I was there at the beginning, so she must have gone there after I left. I also didn't see anyone passing through Medbay or Electrical on my route. \n\nFrank, if you went from Electrical to Medbay and then Upper Engine, we might have just missed each other. Bob, can you confirm if you saw Frank in Upper Engine like he claims? And Diana, we haven't heard your location yet this round. I don't have enough info to accuse anyone right now, so I'll wait to hear what Bob and Diana have to say."}}
{"timestamp": 1779342268.9154177, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 21, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I can confirm Frank's story completely. I saw him enter Medbay from Electrical early in the round, and then he came up to Upper Engine where we hung out for a bit before I went up to Oxygen to do my task. Frank's pathing is exactly what he claimed, so I'm very confident he's innocent. \n\nCharlie, you mentioned you went from Storage to Medbay to Electrical, but you didn't see anyone. That's a little strange since Frank and I were moving through that side of the map, but it's possible we just missed each other. \n\nDiana, we really need to hear where you've been because right now it's between you and Charlie. However, since there are only four of us left and one Duck, voting incorrectly here would put us at a huge risk of losing. Unless Diana says something completely contradictory, I think the safest play is to skip this vote, stay grouped up next round, and catch the Duck in the act. I'm voting to skip."}}
{"timestamp": 1779342284.2822847, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 21, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "My route this round was Navigation to start, then I passed through Storage, up to Medbay, and finally to Upper Engine to do my task. I must have arrived in Upper Engine right after Bob went to Oxygen and Frank headed back down, because the room was empty when I got there. \n\nI didn't see Alice in Storage when I passed through, so she must have arrived there later in the round. Charlie, it's interesting that you claim you went from Storage up to Medbay and over to Electrical. I was passing through those bottom and middle rooms too and didn't see you at all, which makes me a little suspicious of you. \n\nHowever, Bob makes a great point. With only four of us left, a wrong vote here is game over. I don't want to risk throwing the game on a guess. Skipping and sticking together next round is definitely the smartest move. I'm voting to skip."}}
